# LCA-FCDI public repository. WHITELIST: every file is ignored except the files named below (the allow-list of
# the data layer, datalayer.DEPOSIT, and the repository's root files). Results, figures, documents, licensed
# data (also under another name) and caches therefore cannot be committed by accident. The code writes every
# result into 01_Data/02_Processed/ (and run folders inside it); none is published: flow-level and scenario
# results combined with the public inventory recover licensed factors. To publish another file, add it to the
# allow-list and here, and run the deposit checks.
*
!*/
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
